sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Shift as Shift
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Shift: schedule(personId, startsAt, endsAt, eventId, role, notes)
    Note over Shift: Policies: shiftRead, shiftWrite, shiftExecute
    Note over Shift: Guards (5)
    Shift->>Shift: guard[0]: self.scheduledAt == null
    Shift->>Shift: guard[1]: self.status == #quot;scheduled#quot;
    Shift->>Shift: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    Shift->>Shift: guard[3]: self.person != null
    Shift->>Shift: guard[4]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;workforceManageAccess#quot;)
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.personId
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.eventId
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.startsAt
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.endsAt
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.role
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.notes
    Shift->>Shift: mutate.scheduledAt
    Shift->>EventBus: emit ShiftScheduled on shift.scheduled
    Shift-->>-Client: void